       "$B$ is $5$ less than $A$",
       "$B=A-5$ (the same as $A=B+5$)"
      ],
      [
       "$A$ is $4$ times $B$",
       "$A=4B$ $\\;$ (not $B+4$)"
      ],
      [
       "twice / double",
       "always $\\times2$; $\\;$ half: always $\\div2$"
      ],
      [
       "$B$ is a quarter less than $A$",
       "$B=\\frac34A$ $\\;$ (the quarter is of $A$)"
      ],
      [
       "the difference between $A$ and $B$ is $12$",
       "bigger minus smaller: $A-B=12$ or $B-A=12$"
      ],
      [
       "is, makes up $\\;\\cdot\\;$ of",
